                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The funeral of King George VI was held in London on February 15. Secretary of
                    State Acheson was the principal representative of President Truman. Acheson’s
                    personal recollections of the day are to be found in Acheson, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Present at the Creation</hi>, pages 610–614.</p>
            </div>
